title: GSD5 v. HyperGSD API

A side-by-side of the two plugins' extension surfaces, for content migrating from GSD5 or targeting both.

! Identity model

|Dimension |GSD5 |HyperGSD |h
|Item type |`gsd_type` field with five fixed values |Type ''tags'' (`$:/GSD/Action` etc.) via the extensible `$:/tags/hypergsd/Type` tag list |
|Realm |`gsd_realm` field + `$:/currentRealm` ("all") |`$:/GSD/Realm/<name>` tags + `$:/config/hypergsd/realm-selection` (multi-select set + `no-realm` sentinel; pristine = all; realm-less inclusion orthogonal) |
|Context |`gsd_type[context]` tension |`GSD/Contexts` tag (the dashboard is the tag list); multiple context tags per action |

! Lists

|GSD5 |HyperGSD |h
|`<<gsd5-list>>` macro — fixed questionnaire (`gsd_type`, `gsd_status`, `gsd_complete`, `realmAware`, `sort`, `order`, `groupBy`, `customFilter`, `dateTemplate`, `ownerField/owner`, `hideFutureProj`) assembled by the `list-composer` JS macro |`<$hgsd.list list-filter="…">` — any filter; `group-by`/`group-state`, `future-items-sweep` (≈`hideFutureProj`, actually enforced); `ownerField/owner` and `dateTemplate` have no equivalent |

! Widgets

|GSD5 |HyperGSD |h
|`<$complete>` (JS) |row checkboxes + `hgsd-handle-click` (delegated; stamps `gsd_comp_date`, clears on un-check, promotes dependants) |
|`<$convert>` |`<$hgsd.convert>` (tag swap; clears `gsd_prerequisites`) |
|— |`<$hgsd.realm-picker>` (bound realm select for sub-plugins) |
|`<$gsdtiddler>` new-item button |`<$hgsd.new-button>` (adds `gsd-context`, `gsd-realm`) |
|`<$prereq>` JS select |`<$hgsd.pick>` / `<$hgsd.pick-field>` popup pickers on the `gsd_prerequisites` list field |
|— |`<$refresh>` freeze gate (performance architecture absent in GSD5) |

The compat widgets (`<$hgsd.complete>`, `<$hgsd.toggle>`, legacy `$gsd5.*` aliases) were removed 2026-09-01 — completion flows through the delegated checkbox contract.

! Extension tags

|GSD5 |HyperGSD |h
|`$:/tags/GSD5ListItemPrefix` / `Suffix` |`$:/tags/hypergsd/Fragment/Row/Prefix` / `/Suffix` (restored; ordering opt-in via tag-tiddler `list`) |
|`$:/tags/GSD5DashboardLists` + per-dashboard tags |`$:/tags/hypergsd/Lists/Dashboard` + family |
|`GSD5PanelCore` + hardcoded panel doodads |`$:/tags/hypergsd/PanelTemplate` + `Group/*` (tag-driven, ordered) |
|— |`$:/tags/hypergsd/ModalTemplate` + `Group/*` |
|— |`$:/tags/hypergsd/Type` tag list and `$:/tags/hypergsd/AfterCreation` |
|`$:/config/GSD5*/visibility/*` |`$:/config/hypergsd*/visibility/*` (multids defaults) |

! Fields

|GSD5 |HyperGSD |h
|`gsd_type`, `gsd_realm` |removed in favour of tags |
|`gsd_status`, `gsd_complete`, `gsd_comp_date`, `gsd_project`, `gsd_contact` |unchanged |
|`gsd_action` (single prerequisite) |`gsd_prerequisites` (titlelist) |
|`gsd_tickdate` / `gsd_tickdays` |`gsd_tickler_date` / `gsd_tickler_repeat_days` (in the [[HyperGSD-Ticklers|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-ticklers/readme]] sub-plugin) |
|— |`gsd_action_status` / `gsd_project_status` (per-type status memory) |

! Not ported

The `_fieldvalue` filter operator is obsolete (core `get[]` covers it).

! Migrating GSD5 tiddlers

For converting GSD5 tickler data to the renamed fields, see [[Migrating from GSD5 to HyperGSD]].